      "writtenOn": "2020-07-14T06:16:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "But if you do want them, we need to enable all of the different options here.\n\nLook at the CONFIG_USB_STORAGE_* symbols, those need to be enabled.\n\nAlso, you do want CONFIG_USB_UAS as well, as not all UAS devices can fall-back to slower/older usb-storage protocol and you will want the increased speed support for them.\n\nAnd I still do not know what \"udisk\" is, any hints?",
